 <h3><u>Sarwar ke azadar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>sarwar ke azadar - 6</p> 
  <p>mazloom ki talwar - 2 sarwar ke azadar<br> hai deen ke madadgar sarwar ke azadar - 2</p> 
  <p>1. Allah ne jab khalq ke meyaar banaye<br> jo zarf kushada the wo sardar banaye<br> sardar me kuch sahibe anwaar banaye<br> anwaar tarashe to azadar banaye<br> Ab jo mere maula ka azadar nahi hai<br> khudse zara soche ke wo bakaar nahi hai</p> 
  <p>2. Takhleeq ki tarkeeb me hai 4 anaseer<br> sab hai mere maula ke azadar anaseer<br> is waaste hai sahibe asraar anaseer<br> khud karte hai is baat ka iqraar anaseer<br> na aag na paani se na mitti se hawa se<br> hum khalq hue fatima zehra ki dua se</p> 
  <p>3. sach hai ke nazar ho to hate ayb nazar ka<br> mausam to kabhi dekhiye tauheed nagar ka<br> maghmoom fiza surkh shafaq huzn sahar ka<br> kaala hai gilaaf isliye Allah ke ghar ka<br> tauheed parastaare wali ibne wali hai<br> khaaliq bhi azaadare husain ibne ali hai</p> 
  <p>4. kis zarf ka haamil hai azadar ka sina<br> na bughz na ilhaad na ohaam na kina<br> hai karbobala ka yaha aabad madina<br> is shehr me dushwaar hai agyaar ka jina<br> sine pe jo maatam ki ye tehreeq chali hai<br> sine me hai dil dil me hussain ibne ali hai</p> 
  <p>5. hum sino pe maatam se banate hai musalle<br> hoti hai azaan jab to sajate hai musalle<br> maatam ke julooso me bichaate hai musalle<br> khud apni zubaa se ye batate hai musalle<br> sajdo me bhi shabbir ko rota hai namazi<br> shabbir ka har matami hota hai namazi</p> 
  <p>6. uthta hai jo maatam ko azadar ka panja<br> tehzeeb ke sine pe hai afqaar ka panja<br> 5 ungliya hai 5 ke iqraar ka panja<br> har duar me har zulm ke inqaar ka panja<br> islam ki buniyad ka dhaancha bhi yahi hai<br> rukhsaare yazidi pe tamacha bhi yahi hai</p> 
  <p>7. Hubdaar ki aankhon me hai rehmat ke zakhire<br> palko me chupe hai kahi ashko ke jazeere<br> jab kohe basirat se utarte hai ye hire<br> ho jaate hai tabdil muqaddar ke vatire<br> sidra se azadar ko aati ye sada hai<br> is jins ka mehshar me kharidar khuda hai</p> 
  <p>8. Ek ashk se ho jaati hai saason ki taharat<br> ek ashk se buj jaati hai dozakh ki hararat<br> ek ashk se kar sakte ho jannat ki tijarat<br> ek ashk se hojaati hai maula ki ziyarat<br> aankhon ko agar rone ki aadat nahi hogi<br> turbat me bhi maula ki ziyarat nahi hogi&nbsp;</p> 
